WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:06.998
Grace Mwangi runs a community health organisation in western Kenya.

2
00:00:06.998 --> 00:00:11.952
She is setting up ImpactMEL for her team, starting from the sign-up page.

3
00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.009
Her name, her work email, and a password.

4
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:25.648
ImpactMEL sends a six-digit code to that address, to check it is really hers.

5
00:00:26.048 --> 00:00:29.104
She copies the code from her email and types it in.

6
00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:33.646
Next, the name of the organisation: Riverbend Community Health.

7
00:00:34.495 --> 00:00:37.804
She can pay by card or invoice now, or try it first.

8
00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:40.159
She starts the thirty-day free trial.

9
00:00:40.597 --> 00:00:42.761
Onboarding takes four quick steps.

10
00:00:42.761 --> 00:00:46.452
First, her role, so her home page opens on what she needs.

11
00:00:46.865 --> 00:00:50.094
She leads the organisation, so she picks director.

12
00:00:50.525 --> 00:00:52.257
Then the workspace itself.

13
00:00:52.257 --> 00:00:56.322
Her logo goes in the sidebar and on every report she exports.

14
00:00:56.757 --> 00:00:58.591
The head office is in Kenya.

15
00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:01.145
The currency follows, Kenyan shillings,

16
00:01:01.145 --> 00:01:04.289
and she can change it if she reports in dollars.

17
00:01:04.712 --> 00:01:06.436
Now the reporting calendar.

18
00:01:06.436 --> 00:01:11.162
Her funders want quarterly figures, and the financial year starts in July.

19
00:01:11.573 --> 00:01:17.040
ImpactMEL lays out the reporting periods for her, so nobody has to type dates.

20
00:01:17.447 --> 00:01:18.535
Last, her team.

21
00:01:18.535 --> 00:01:24.627
She invites Peter, who will look after monitoring and evaluation, as an M&E officer.

22
00:01:25.235 --> 00:01:28.098
Peter gets an email to set his own password.

23
00:01:28.098 --> 00:01:30.310
She sends the invite and finishes.

24
00:01:30.712 --> 00:01:32.594
And she lands on her home page.

25
00:01:32.594 --> 00:01:35.628
The workspace has her logo, her reporting periods,

26
00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.753
and the first colleague on the way.

27
00:01:38.187 --> 00:01:41.275
The reporting periods she chose are already set up.

28
00:01:41.275 --> 00:01:43.940
Coming up shows when the first quarter ends.

29
00:01:44.369 --> 00:01:50.341
And under People, Peter is listed as an M&E officer, invited and waiting to accept.

30
00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:54.777
From here, the next job is the results framework: the outcomes,

31
00:01:54.777 --> 00:01:58.085
outputs and indicators the team will report against.
